API CONNECTION:

Use Axios.

Backend URL:

VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

Create a centralized Axios instance.

Connect frontend to these APIs:

POST /auth/register
POST /auth/login

GET /profile
PUT /profile

POST /interviews
GET /interviews
GET /interviews/:id

POST /questions/generate
POST /answers
POST /evaluation

GET /results/:interviewId
GET /history
GET /recommendations


AUTHENTICATION:

- Store authentication state securely.
- Attach JWT to protected API requests.
- Redirect unauthenticated users to Login.
- Redirect authenticated users to Dashboard.
- Implement logout.
- Handle expired/invalid tokens.


